     "verdict": "passed",
     "claim": "When ldconfig genuinely cannot be executed, the product still decides correctly and does not fall back to a patched or assumed answer.",
     "evidence": {
      "enforcement": "RLIMIT_NPROC = 0 made every exec() fail with BlockingIOError [Errno 11] /sbin/ldconfig during env construction",
